## 🎯 Day 53 Objective

Build a **production-usable threat model for autonomous AI agents** — the class of system that plans across steps, holds memory, carries delegated credentials, calls tools, and talks to other agents.

The LLM Top 10 assumes the model *answers*. This threat model assumes the model *acts*. That single shift changes the blast radius from "a bad response" to "a chain of authenticated actions against production systems."

Deliverable: reference architecture → trust boundaries → STRIDE decomposition → ASI01–ASI10 control matrix → AI-amplified kill chain → a pre-deployment governance gate a review board can actually run.

